            <title>[IGNITE-13299] Flacky GridServiceDeployClusterReadOnlyModeTest and all including tests.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-13299</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Starting GridServiceDeployClusterReadOnlyModeTest#testDeployClusterSingletonAllowed until failure and catch assertion on 200 iteration.  This failure is due incorrect assumption that if service already deployed org.apache.ignite.services.Service#execute would be called before  returning from deployment would be happened. &lt;/p&gt;</description>
